WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.308
Learn to describe real life situations using positive and negative values and count

00:00:05.308 --> 00:00:09.629
forwards and backwards with positive and negative whole numbers through zero

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.873
The temperature is 4 degrees C. It becomes 2 degrees C colder. What is the new

00:00:15.873 --> 00:00:19.602
temperature? The answer is 2 degrees C. Colder means subtract 2.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:26.227
A mountain village is at 9 degrees C. The reading changes by minus 3 degrees C. What

00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:29.965
temperature is recorded? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:35.861
The answer is 6 degrees C. Add the signed change: 9 minus 3 equals 6.
